# Intermediate artifacts. Both are rebuildable from tools/, and neither should be
# republished here - the notes are our own words, the raw material is not ours.
transcripts/
sources/*/fulltext/

# Kept: sources/*/index.json and assignments.tsv. They are small, they record
# exactly which documents were ingested and under which licence, and they make a
# rebuild reproducible.

# Figures from the open-access papers the notes cite. The repo root ignores *.jpg
# and *.png as working images that are not part of the app; these are different —
# they are library content, and FIGURES.md embeds them by relative path, so the
# index is broken for anyone who clones without them. Narrowly un-ignored: only
# under a source's figures/ folder, nowhere else.
#
# Everything here carries a Creative Commons or public-domain licence and is
# stored unmodified, with a per-paper credit line in <source>/figures/README.md.
# Figures without such a licence are deliberately absent — FIGURES.md links to the
# publisher's copy instead. Do not relax that rule: this repo is public.
!**/figures/**/*.jpg
!**/figures/**/*.jpeg
!**/figures/**/*.png
!**/figures/**/*.gif
!**/figures/**/*.tif
